{"success": true, "data": {"experiments": {"exp015": {"status": "RUNNING", "created_at": "2026-05-14T12:48:38.065Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-14T13:10:28.292Z", "hypothesis": "Sparse GRPO + 训练稳定性修复。纯 sparse reward（won=10.0，无 valid_action_bonus，无 format_penalty）。针对 exp012b 的 step 7 catastrophic collapse（grad_norm 1.48→0.094），三项修复：LR 1e-7（降 10 倍防单步更新过激）、kl_loss_coef 0.1（增 10 倍约束策略偏移）、max_grad_norm=1.0（梯度裁剪）。从 exp008 step 5 checkpoint 恢复，GRPO 30 步。", "parent": "exp012b", "notes": "配置就绪。关键变更：exp008_grpo/global_step_5 已被清理，改为从 SFT 模型（qwen3_sft_final）全新开始 GRPO（resume_mode: disable）。这意味着模型没有先前 GRPO 经验，但起点更干净。配置确认：LR=1e-7, kl_loss_coef=0.1, grad_clip=1.0, valid_action_bonus=0, format_penalty=0, env_groups=4, AlfworldSG tag。磁盘 219GB 可用。", "metrics": {"step": 1, "total_steps": 30, "val_step0_success": 0, "val_step0_action_is_valid": 0.858, "val_step0_pass_at1": 0, "val_step0_episodic_return": 0, "val_step0_response_length": 2797.5, "val_train_transition": "passed", "estimated_total_time_min": 163, "time_per_step_min": 5.6}}, "exp014b": {"status": "PREPARING", "created_at": "2026-05-14T12:45:27.876Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-14T12:48:37.433Z", "hypothesis": "极低 Dense Reward: valid_action_bonus=0.01（1:1000 比例），测试极弱 bonus 能否防 collapse 又不引发 gaming。如果 bonus 弱到不影响 GRPO reward ranking，模型不会被诱导走捷径。success_reward=10.0, format_penalty=0, 从 exp008 step 5 checkpoint 恢复, GRPO 30 步。", "parent": "exp013f", "conclusion": "killed", "notes": "D013 撤销：Director 修订决策，改为 exp015。exp014b 等 exp015 结果后再决定。"}, "exp014a": {"status": "PREPARING", "created_at": "2026-05-14T12:45:27.347Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-14T12:48:35.102Z", "hypothesis": "Success-Gated Dense Reward: valid_action_bonus=0.15 只在 group 内至少一条 trajectory success 时才给。消除 reward gaming 的独立最大化路径——没有 success 就没有 bonus，模型必须探索 success。success_reward=10.0, format_penalty=0, 从 exp008 step 5 checkpoint 恢复, GRPO 30 步。", "parent": "exp013f", "conclusion": "killed", "notes": "D013 撤销：Director 修订决策，success-gated bonus 有 bootstrap 问题（初始 success=0 时 bonus 永远